{
    "title": "Piano Tiles \u2122 - Tap Music Game",
    "description": "#1 Free Game in more than 40 countries\r\n#10 Free Game in more than 100 countries\r\n\r\nThe Original Piano Tiles \u2122 game is back and better than ever! Don't Tap The White Tile, tap only the black ones!\r\n\r\nTap musical tiles to play piano songs in this classic addictive piano game. Make music with ease when you tap to the beat, getting faster and faster as piano levels progress. But be careful, DON'T TOUCH THE WHITE TILES! \r\n\r\nTap the piano tile... Sounds easy? Tap to try and see how you stack up against friends. Tap musical tiles in the original classic tap tile arcade game!\r\n\r\n= Piano Tiles \u2122 Features =\r\n\r\n\u25c8 Classic Piano Soundtracks\r\n- Tap along to over 60 Piano Songs!\r\n- Classical piano and popular tap music tracks\r\n- Earn music notes to unlock your favorite songs\r\n- Looking for a bigger challenge? Play with typewriter sounds or disable audio!\r\n- Customize your musical piano playlist!\r\n\r\n\u25c8 Addicting Gameplay Modes\r\n- More than 35 awesome game modes\r\n- Classic piano tap gameplay mode - the original Piano Tiles \u2122 1!\r\n- Arcade mode: endless tile tapping require fast reflexes\r\n- Rush mode: tap tiles in reverse or play in pro mode\r\n- Piano grid: play 4x4 classic mode or move up to 5x5, even 6x6!\r\n- Zen mode: play at your own pace for a more relaxing game experience.\r\n\r\n\u25c8 Online game features\r\n- Social network sharing to show of your top tap tally.\r\n- Leaderboards: compete for the worldwide high score!\r\n\r\n\u25c8 Offline game\r\n- Play online or offline!\r\n- Tap any time, anywhere! No wifi needed.\r\n\r\n\u25c8 Tons more!\r\n- Muti-color themes with dozens of color options\r\n- Silky smooth gameplay\r\n- Optimized for high resolution screens\r\n\r\nThe original addicting classic music game is back! Download the original piano tile game, learn the notes, hit the correct beat and be an amazing accompanist. Bring your best to every song performance. The best rhythm games of 2023 are a tap away, download now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "#1 Free Game in more than 40 countries<br>#10 Free Game in more than 100 countries<br><br>The Original Piano Tiles \u2122 game is back and better than ever! Don&#39;t Tap The White Tile, tap only the black ones!<br><br>Tap musical tiles to play piano songs in this classic addictive piano game. Make music with ease when you tap to the beat, getting faster and faster as piano levels progress. But be careful, DON&#39;T TOUCH THE WHITE TILES! <br><br>Tap the piano tile... Sounds easy? Tap to try and see how you stack up against friends. Tap musical tiles in the original classic tap tile arcade game!<br><br>= Piano Tiles \u2122 Features =<br><br>\u25c8 Classic Piano Soundtracks<br>- Tap along to over 60 Piano Songs!<br>- Classical piano and popular tap music tracks<br>- Earn music notes to unlock your favorite songs<br>- Looking for a bigger challenge? Play with typewriter sounds or disable audio!<br>- Customize your musical piano playlist!<br><br>\u25c8 Addicting Gameplay Modes<br>- More than 35 awesome game modes<br>- Classic piano tap gameplay mode - the original Piano Tiles \u2122 1!<br>- Arcade mode: endless tile tapping require fast reflexes<br>- Rush mode: tap tiles in reverse or play in pro mode<br>- Piano grid: play 4x4 classic mode or move up to 5x5, even 6x6!<br>- Zen mode: play at your own pace for a more relaxing game experience.<br><br>\u25c8 Online game features<br>- Social network sharing to show of your top tap tally.<br>- Leaderboards: compete for the worldwide high score!<br><br>\u25c8 Offline game<br>- Play online or offline!<br>- Tap any time, anywhere! No wifi needed.<br><br>\u25c8 Tons more!<br>- Muti-color themes with dozens of color options<br>- Silky smooth gameplay<br>- Optimized for high resolution screens<br><br>The original addicting classic music game is back! Download the original piano tile game, learn the notes, hit the correct beat and be an amazing accompanist. Bring your best to every song performance. The best rhythm games of 2023 are a tap away, download now!",
